{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-06-phl-tickets/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:31:59.343Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7a46a8705c60e5f103033db8be8a6cb43a4f331b1c60ce4390340fa7a17988dc","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"Bettina, here's what I found for Kwame's account review. Sources: #coastal-team, #coastal-random, Moss's Coastal digests, and your Dec 2025 Pellucid cutover note. Pellow Home Living / Covey & Lark items (PD-4821, #8812) are left out.\n\nPELLUCID HARBOR LOGISTICS (PHL, Gulf Coast)\n- #4419: Yard_Dwell_Summary report times out when filtered by container length. Open. Source: Moss's Coastal cheat sheet.\n- #PD-8841: chassis pool holds on double-booked gates (Gate 4B). Source: your cutover recap, Dec 2025. It doesn't give a status.\n- No ticket number: Berth 2 yard map CSV import bug (your cutover recap), and chassis pool validation at Gate 4 during shift change (cheat sheet, described as the main friction point).\n\nDRIFTMOOR MARINE FREIGHT (DMF, Puget Sound)\n- Feature request #882: bulk-clear button for departed barges, requested by warehouse managers. Source: Moss's cheat sheet.\n- #4419 again: Moss's 2 Nov 2025 digest lists it as a DMF barge slip 7 schedule sync ticket, with a patched manifest CSV requested before the 06:00 shift.\n- No ticket number: Tide-table import macro failed on Terminal B. Engineering gave the night dispatcher a manual CSV patch (cheat sheet).\n\nOne conflict to resolve first: #4419 is described as a PHL report timeout in the cheat sheet and as a DMF barge slip sync ticket in the Nov 2025 digest. I can't tell which is right, or whether it's a typo, so please check it in the ticket system before the review. I've listed it under both accounts for now.\n\nThe channels and notes I can see don't have status or resolution for most of these. Kwame will need to confirm the current state.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
